  "transfer_findings": [
    "Both Development calibration families independently suggested lowering the 60m raw-equivalent threshold from 2.0 to roughly 1.22-1.27, but this static 2020 calibration did not transfer cleanly to the 2026 five-carrier evaluation.",
    "Lower 60m thresholds materially reduce cross-carrier SIDEWAYS occupancy dispersion, but they worsen several co-primary reversal/persistence dispersion metrics, especially DOWN opposite-entry10 dispersion.",
